q.com/s?__biz=MzAxNDEwNjk5OQ==&mid=2650546649&idx=1&sn=2976d10c9e33ceab48cd6ba5a82ead51","date":"2026-10-30 10:37:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_4c6347cf32.json","topicTag":"other","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"大淘宝技术","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":42,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_9aaee48484","title":"为什么 AI 能解千禧年题，但还是做不到 RSI｜Hao 好聊趋势","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mjc1NjM3MjY2MA==&mid=2691573863&idx=1&sn=d79576b3372f4261546911bb904af466","date":"2026-11-01 19:19:00","oneSentenceSummary":"文章分析了 AI 在数学物理等符号自足领域的卓越表现，与在需要跨层级视角转换的经验科学领域的有限创新能力之间的反差，探讨了 RSI 实践中的局限性及其背后的认知机制根源。","summary":"文章从 AI 在数学、物理等科研领域的突破表现切入，分析了 AI 在攻克千禧年难题（如 ETH、Yang-Mills 证明）时的表现，同时指出在 RSI 实践中，AI 的科研能力存在显著局限。通过 Anthropic 的 AGENT4SCI 实验，文章发现 AI 的提升主要来自常规机器学习工程套路，而非真正的科研洞察。文章进一步探讨了 AI 在不同科学领域的表现差异，认为关键在于「符号自足性」——纯数学领域符号与底层机制一致，AI 能高效解题；而经验科学领域符号与底层物理实在脱节，AI 缺乏跳出题面层级的思考能力。最后指出，AI 的局限可能源于后训练中的「应试条件反射」，而非能力缺失。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_9aaee48484.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"腾讯科技","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":54,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_70021ec7db","title":"他给普通人配了个 “AI 剧组”丨 100 个 AI 创业者","link":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1979487720754673024","date":"2026-11-01 02:50:01","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_70021ec7db.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"知乎专栏","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":18,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_a62a98baf3","title":"Super-agent 设计探索：迈向更自主的 Agent 系统","link":"https://www.uied.cn/posts/922127","date":"2026-10-31 23:11:31","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_a62a98baf3.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"uied.cn","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":52,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_9aac947220","title":"Anthropic 不只是一家公司，更是一笔回报","link":"https://www.thebignewsletter.com/p/why-anthropics-filing-crushed-tech","date":"2026-10-31 20:10:43","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_9aac947220.json","topicTag":"other","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"thebignewsletter.com","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":11,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_7b51860b35","title":"大模型从 60 分走到 90 分，下一代 AI 的突破在哪里？｜对话上交大陈明达","link":"https://www.163.com/dy/article/LAIRENG705119734.html?clickfrom=w_tech","date":"2026-10-31 13:31:39","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_7b51860b35.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"163.com","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":36,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_bc9518cf5d","title":"自进化（Self-evolving／RSI），一篇就够了 - 知乎","link":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2065227313973825752","date":"2026-10-31 02:35:36","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_bc9518cf5d.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"知乎专栏","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":52,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_b256cb1099","title":"AI Agent 手册 · AI Agent 手册","link":"https://aliyun.github.io/ai-agent-handbook/about.html","date":"2026-10-31 02:23:32","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_b256cb1099.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"aliyun.github.io","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":17,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_00f2079268","title":"谷歌这份财报，把市场吓到了","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4NzE1NTAwNA==&mid=2247483903&idx=1&sn=bf1054ae68a80cb11ce0d3c8403bf0a2&chksm=fc8386ad13559078eb7991163fdda56087f039918f1ff455b7f0e220eaacd6c1ceeaf6e8784f","date":"2026-10-30 11:42:56","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_00f2079268.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Business_Tech","sourceName":"Joey研究随笔","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":20,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_bf7c86e906","title":"divagr1925/QwenPU · Hugging Face","link":"https://huggingface.co/divagr1925/QwenPU","date":"2026-11-01 18:15:39","oneSentenceSummary":"QwenPU 将 32 位 RISC-V CPU 和向量单元直接嵌入 Qwen3.5-4B 的权重中，使模型能够在前向传播过程中以神经网络的形式执行 Andrej Karpathy 的 stories260K 程序。","summary":"QwenPU 是一个经过修改的 Qwen3.5-4B 语言模型，它将 32 位 RISC-V CPU 和自定义向量单元编译进其 Transformer 层中。这个嵌入式计算机可以在模型的前向传播过程中执行 stories260K（一个 26 万参数的神经网络）等程序，使模型能够通过将神经网络作为程序运行来生成文本。向量单元支持矩阵乘法、量化、残差加法、注意力计算等操作，并以 DeltaNet 头作为独立记忆。与纯 C 和 Qwenputer-npu 实现相比，QwenPU 每个故事 token 的追踪 token 数减少了 45 倍到 45，000 倍，展现出显著的效率提升。检查点大小为 26.7 GB，完整加载需要 40 GB GPU。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_bf7c86e906.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Hacker News - Newest: \"LLM\"","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":3,"score":85},{"id":"RAW_e327f05478","title":"工作流 vs 智能体","link":"https://dev.to/salmonjoy/workflow-vs-agent-40a8","date":"2026-11-01 12:54:30","oneSentenceSummary":"一份技术指南与架构框架，帮助在 AI 应用中选择确定性工作流、自主智能体或混合方案。","summary":"本文探讨了确定性工作流与自主 AI 智能体之间的结构性权衡。文章基于执行路径可预测性、审计要求以及对实时数据的需求，提供了一套决策矩阵。作者梳理了分层职责，并为金融科技入驻等真实场景提供了架构决策记录（ADR），强调治理与成本效率。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_e327f05478.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"DEV Community: machinelearning","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":5,"score":88},{"id":"RAW_2de8f6fdd1","title":"上海交大等开源 EvaOmni：1，027 问答检验视听证据","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk3NTc1NTU0Mw==&mid=2247515188&idx=1&sn=4475df9f60886758a674deae7fa198a5","date":"2026-11-01 12:18:00","oneSentenceSummary":"上海交大、复旦及腾讯优图联合开源 EvaOmni 基准，首创“答案+视听证据定位”双重评测机制，包含 1，027 道问答，评估全模态大模型的细粒度推理与精准溯源能力。","summary":"上海交大、复旦大学和腾讯优图实验室联合开源了名为 EvaOmni 的全模态大语言模型评测基准。这一基准首次提出“答案+视听证据定位”双重评测机制，包含 392 段时长为 1-12 分钟的视频和 1，027 道人工标注问答，覆盖 15 种细粒度能力。基准将能力划分为三个层级：Level 1（检索与定位）、Level 2（基础理解）和 Level 3（复杂推理），要求模型在给出答案的同时返回音频和视频的时间区间。对 24 个 Omni LLM 进行评测显示，Gemini3.7-Flash 在答案准确率上达到 79.4%，但双模态精确定位得分 B.G. 仅为 35.1%，与人类专家的 94.3% 相差 59.2 个百分点。研究还发现原生音频优于 ASR 转录，在 MiMo-V2.5 测试中分别提升 8.1、10.3 和 8.9 个百分点。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_2de8f6fdd1.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"魔搭ModelScope社区","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":11,"score":88},{"id":"RAW_23e7900085","title":"DeepSeek 超级智能体：以注意力预算驱动的编程智能体","link":"https://dev.to/ali_82f3409ed625e8ba8515b/deepseek-super-agent-coding-agents-on-an-attention-budget-35of","date":"2026-11-01 12:00:41","oneSentenceSummary":"DeepSeek 发布了一款开源编程智能体原型，通过无状态架构将人类注意力视为有限预算，优先最小化对人类注意力的消耗。","summary":"DeepSeek 推出了一套「超级智能体」框架，旨在解决智能体疲劳问题。与传统多智能体系统用大量通知和请求淹没开发者不同，该系统采用两层架构（路由层与工作层），包含五个核心原语：来源、触发器、线程、授权和工单。它采用无状态评估，仅通过结构化的注意力字段请求人类介入，而非从对话记录中猜测意图。每个工作单元在独立的 git worktree 中运行，并设有硬性时间限制，以防止对话漂移和资源失控消耗。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_23e7900085.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"DEV Community: machinelearning","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":6,"score":86},{"id":"RAW_0680149507","title":"为什么稀疏 35B MoE 在 CPU 上比稠密 27B 模型跑得更快","link":"https://dev.to/ginigen_ai_010d9180cbbdb1/why-a-sparse-35b-moe-runs-faster-on-a-cpu-than-a-dense-27b-model-4fn5","date":"2026-11-01 11:14:52","oneSentenceSummary":"本文解释了为什么稀疏 35B MoE 模型能在 CPU 上胜过稠密 27B 模型：它在 token 生成时减少了读取权重所需的内存带宽。","summary":"作者探讨了大语言模型在 CPU 上的性能瓶颈，指出生成速度主要受限于内存带宽，而非总参数量。文章以 POCKET-35B（一个混合专家模型）为例，证明它在 MacBook M3 Pro 上比稠密的 Bonsai-27B 模型快 3 倍，因为每个 token 只激活一部分专家（256 个中的 8 个）。文中还解释了为什么在 H100 等高端硬件上，稠密模型在提示词处理阶段可能仍然胜出（受限于计算），并就使用混合精度量化在边缘设备上保持质量给出了建议。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_0680149507.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"DEV Community: machinelearning","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":5,"score":89},{"id":"RAW_4abcab2069","title":"智能体提示人类：用智能体处理长周期金融工作 — Latent Space","link":"https://latent.space/p/arca/","date":"2026-11-01 00:05:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_4abcab2069.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Latent.Space","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":3,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_376b36f072","title":"来自梵蒂冈的报道","link":"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/report-from-the-vatican","date":"2026-10-31 23:17:33","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_376b36f072.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"Marcus on AI","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":12,"score":90},{"i