data/articles/2026/10/RAW_760618572d.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"量子位","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":20,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_ecb41312e0","title":"彻底爆了，第 3 篇可信 RSI 全面综述出炉","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MTYzMzMxMA==&mid=2247513129&idx=1&sn=635fb8358da2a9b6f5914f39ed08dac2","date":"2026-10-30 11:50:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_ecb41312e0.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"PaperAgent","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":8,"score":85},{"id":"RAW_a6dd687321","title":"CMU 全新 LLM 范式：大型流式语言模型","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0MTYzMzMxMA==&mid=2247513129&idx=2&sn=e69fe9310f3f8fa409209a72051003f4","date":"2026-10-30 11:50:00","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"PaperAgent","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":7,"score":85},{"id":"RAW_2876acf7af","title":"如何用 Kimi 做出更好的 3D 作品？官方教程来啦","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzcwMjM3ODEzOA==&mid=2247487788&idx=1&sn=f95012a4f64af174b1c0418e8d2cffe0","date":"2026-10-30 11:21:00","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Artificial_Intelligence","sourceName":"月之暗面 Kimi","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":23,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_8bb989a607","title":"用 JEPA 证明并改进柏拉图表示假说","link":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.39302","date":"2026-11-01 21:24:49","oneSentenceSummary":"本文利用联合嵌入预测架构（JEPA）将柏拉图表示假说证明为一条定理，表明多模态模型会收敛到共享表示，而下一词元预测是通往柏拉图表示的一条低效路径。","summary":"本文利用联合嵌入预测架构（JEPA）将柏拉图表示假说证明为一条定理。论文确立：当正样本对是同一场景的两次观测（「良好视图」）时，分别在不同模态上训练的 JEPA 会学到相同的表示（至多相差一个旋转），否则错位程度有界。作者表明，下一词元预测是一种带有「劣质视图」（单个文档的各个部分）的 JEPA，这解释了为何语言模型只有通过规模扩展才能与视觉对齐。在 145k 条图像描述和 940M 张网络图像上的验证揭示了对齐的缩放定律：要达到同等对齐水平，良好视图所需的训练样本比下一词元预测少 42 倍。一个 109M 参数的文本 JEPA 与 DINOv2 和 CLIP 图像编码器的对齐效果，优于所有参数量最高达 72B 的受评估语言模型。作为展示，一次旋转可将分别训练的编码器转变为图像描述器，在 COCO 上达到 CIDEr .838；在无配对基准上，文本 JEPA 的零样本准确率优于参数量最高达 8B 的语言模型（在 ImageNet-100 上 top-5 准确率为 64% 对 56%）。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_8bb989a607.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"Hacker News","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":2,"score":84},{"id":"RAW_d8a03b8f01","title":"Cloudflare 后量子 GeoKey Manager 进入封闭测试，弃用属性基加密","link":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/cf-pq-geokey-manager/","date":"2026-11-01 03:56:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_d8a03b8f01.json","topicTag":"devops","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":3,"score":88},{"id":"RAW_df515a2f6f","title":"OpenBSD 8.0 发布：扩展硬件支持、增强安全性并改进虚拟化","link":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/openbsd-8-released/","date":"2026-11-01 01:00:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_df515a2f6f.json","topicTag":"other","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":2,"score":85},{"id":"RAW_28f4f26a25","title":"Kubernetes 机密容器获得 Fortanix 认证与密钥管理支持","link":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/k8s-confidential-containers/","date":"2026-10-31 16:18:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_28f4f26a25.json","topicTag":"devops","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":3,"score":85},{"id":"RAW_be35f3f423","title":"LocalStack for Azure 进入公开预览，安全设置仅存储不强制执行","link":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/localstack-azure-preview/","date":"2026-10-31 15:57:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_be35f3f423.json","topicTag":"devops","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":3,"score":82},{"id":"RAW_2b96701350","title":"Anthropic 直接掀桌：Code Review 不再留给人","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUxODAzNDg4NQ==&mid=2247565983&idx=1&sn=11aa647e799f1e62c0c46eb8865821cb","date":"2026-10-31 15:26:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_2b96701350.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"小林coding","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":37,"score":87},{"id":"RAW_026096f091","title":"Google 披露 PageBreak AI 安全智能体，已发现 5