The Cloudflare Blog","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":9,"score":89},{"id":"RAW_23880a2dce","title":"如何利用知识图谱检测金融欺诈模式：生产环境实践指南","link":"https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/how-to-detect-financial-fraud-patterns-with-knowledge-graphs-a-production-guide/","date":"2026-10-30 21:57:52","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_23880a2dce.json","topicTag":"other","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"freeCodeCamp","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":16,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_935592f1e9","title":"DoorDash 借助 AI 智能体将杂货复购延迟从 16 秒降至 2 秒","link":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/doordash-ai-grocery-reorder/","date":"2026-10-30 21:31:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_935592f1e9.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":2,"score":87},{"id":"RAW_543ef496c5","title":"Netflix 将 GPU 可靠性视为分布式系统问题","link":"https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/netflix-gpu-distributed-systems/","date":"2026-10-30 20:00:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_543ef496c5.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":3,"score":87},{"id":"RAW_4b24919352","title":"以电商客服为例，看 AgentKit 技能评测如何让 Skill 敢上生产！","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI1MzYzMjE0MQ==&mid=2247523892&idx=1&sn=f210923b89308ffa03e248ab36043d7b","date":"2026-10-30 16:53:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_4b24919352.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"字节跳动技术团队","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":10,"score":92},{"id":"RAW_2da4c9cb1a","title":"同一个模型从 30 分到 95 分：拉开差距的不是模型，是 Harness","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDE0Mjc4MA==&mid=2651296220&idx=2&sn=9511a71511181feae27668ca4818886b","date":"2026-10-30 15:34:00","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/10/RAW_2da4c9cb1a.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Programming_Technology","sourceName":"InfoQ 中文","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":42,"score":90},{"id":"RAW_68ff36057b","title":"19 岁实习生如何为这家估值 20 亿美元的 AI 公司打造增长引擎 | Hector Serrano","link":"https://www.lennysnewsletter.com/p/how-a-19-year-old-intern-built-the","date":"2026-11-01 21:31:36","oneSentenceSummary":"Wispr Flow 的一名 19 岁实习生打造了一套付费 UGC 增长引擎，每月产出 500-600 条广告，帮助公司收入增长 30 倍，展示了 DTC 式创作者合作如何驱动 SaaS 增长。","summary":"Hector Serrano 是 Wispr Flow 的内容负责人，他搭建了一个付费用户生成内容（UGC）项目，签约 50 位创作者，每月产出 500-600 条付费广告，其中头部创作者月收入超过 13，000 美元。他在产品尚未达到产品市场契合度时以 19 岁实习生身份加入，帮助 Wispr Flow 实现收入 30 倍增长，并助力公司达到 20 亿美元估值。文章给出了搭建付费 UGC 项目的分步操作指南，指出顶尖营销人为何「对 AI 过敏」，并解释了 YouTube 为何是 SaaS 公司被低估的增长杠杆。","archive_path":"data/articles/2026/11/RAW_68ff36057b.json","topicTag":"ai-llm","category":"Product_Development","sourceName":"Lenny's Newsletter","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":2,"score":84},{"id":"RAW_99df5b2d9a","title":"版面的美感，来自哪？","link":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4NTk3NzUzOA==&mid=2247616146&idx=1&sn=e59f12f1de647abc809063c05678d623","date":"2026-11-01 16:21:00","oneSentenceSummary":"本文阐述了版面美感的本质不在于装饰，而在于设计师对元素之间关系、空间关系以及信息与读者之间关系的精准控制，这种控制通过留白、对齐、字体、配色和细节等具体手段实现。","summary":"本文从「何为美感」的切入点，系统阐释了版面设计中美感的核心来源是「关系」的控制力。文章首先指出，美感是读者在未阅读内容前，由比例、间距、层级、节奏以及信息与阅读场景匹配度所产生的即时判断；随后通过留白、对齐、字体选择、配色运用和细节处理五个维度，详细说明设计师如何通过控制这些「看不见的关系」来塑造舒适、有序且富有节奏感的版面效果。文章结合日本优秀书籍排版、无印良品的配色实践等案例，强调留白是节奏控制器、对齐是秩序建构器、字体是情感载体、配色是层次分离器，而细节则决定「好」与「真好」的临界点。","topicTag":"other","category":"Product_Development","sourceName":"辛未设计","resourceType":"ARTICLE","readTime":13,"score":89}]
